### Spring E-Commerce API Test Requests
### Use this file with REST Client extensions in VS Code or IntelliJ

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

###

### 2. Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/1

###

### 3. Add New Product (JSON only, no image)
POST {{baseUrl}}/product
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="product"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Laptop",
  "description": "High performance laptop for developers",
  "brand": "TechBrand",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "releaseDate": "2024-01-15",
  "productAvailable": true,
  "stockQuantity": 50
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 4. Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/search?keyword=laptop

###

### 5. Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/product/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="product"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Updated Laptop",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "brand": "TechBrand",
  "price": 1199.99,
  "category": "Electronics",
  "releaseDate": "2024-01-15",
  "productAvailable": true,
  "stockQuantity": 45
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 6. Place Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### 7. Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

###

### 8. Get Order by Order ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD12345678

###

### 9. Update Order Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD12345678/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHIPPED"
}

###

### 10. Cancel Order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD12345678/cancel

###

### 11. Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/product/1

###

### Test Validation Errors

### Invalid Product - Missing Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/product
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="product"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "price": -10,
  "stockQuantity": -5
}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Invalid Order - Missing Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "items": []
}

###

### Invalid Order - Bad Email Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 0
    }
  ]
}

###

### Test Resource Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/99999

###

### Test Insufficient Stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/place
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Smith",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1000
    }
  ]
}

###
